::PC_U06_L05_Q_Q01::
Question ID: PC_U06_L05_Q_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.SEQ.4
Question:
A geometric sequence has first term 3 and common ratio 3. Which expression gives a_n
{
~A. 3+3(n-1)#This choice uses a related idea but does not complete the required reasoning for the stated standard.
~B. 3(3)²#This choice reflects a common misconception or an incomplete step.
~D. 3(3)n#This choice does not match the conditions in the question.
=C. 3(n)²#This changes the sequence structure and does not match the required term pattern.
}

